Design acknowledgement: Humanfia Humanize2 and Flowverse
https://github.com/humanfia/humanize2
https://github.com/humanfia/flowverse

MerLean's optional research checkpoint layer was informed by Humanfia's durable
proof checkpoints, dependency-aware work organization, and separation of proof
repair from integration repair. We acknowledge the Humanfia authors for these
design examples. The inspected revisions were Humanize2
3e0e6edf1d47ae27a70c1a334ee6cf364d05f59b and Flowverse
1dd53c4437e62934ed053bf28fbcdfd0ffa6bbcd (September 10, 2026).

This is a design-inspiration acknowledgement, not a claim that those ideas were
first introduced by Humanfia. No Humanize implementation is vendored in this
checkpoint layer. MerLean implements the feature with its own offline plan lock,
evidence journal, research-scope rules, and unchanged Silver/Gold trust gates.
The upstream runtime's license is Apache-2.0; this acknowledgement does not
relicense upstream material or imply upstream endorsement.
